        },
        {
          "text": " Arai eomit ituŋanan ebe erai enabi, arai bo yenikemoyo, koŋic ŋun nuewadikakinit yes, ebe, eraas aicorakinet naka Ejakait. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
